      <div style="align-self:center; color:#475569; font-size:24px;">→</div>
      <div class="vis-card" style="flex:1; padding:16px;">
        <p style="font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.15em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#4ade80; margin:0 0 6px 0;">④ Respond</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin:0 0 6px 0;">POST back via API</p>
        <p style="font-size:12px; color:#94a3b8; margin:0;">Inline comments + status checks land on the MR/PR.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- GitLab vs GitHub mapping -->
    <div class="vis-grid-2" style="gap:16px;">
      <div class="vis-card" style="padding:14px;">
        <p style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.15em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#fb923c; margin:0 0 10px 0;">GitLab</p>
        <p class="vis-mono" style="font-size:12px; color:#cbd5e1; margin:0 0 4px 0;">webhook event: <span style="color:#2dd4bf;">merge_request</span></p>
        <p class="vis-mono" style="font-size:12px; color:#cbd5e1; margin:0;">post-back: Notes API · Discussions API</p>
      </div>
      <div class="vis-card" style="padding:14px;">
        <p style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.15em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#94a3b8; margin:0 0 10px 0;">GitHub</p>
        <p class="vis-mono" style="font-size:12px; color:#cbd5e1; margin:0 0 4px 0;">webhook event: <span style="color:#2dd4bf;">pull_request</span></p>
        <p class="vis-mono" style="font-size:12px; color:#cbd5e1; margin:0;">post-back: Reviews API · Comments API</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="vis-callout vis-callout-teal" style="text-align:center;">
    Branch protection makes review <strong>mandatory</strong>. Webhooks make it <strong>automatic</strong>. APIs make it <strong>actionable</strong>.
